{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17207670","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17207670","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1720767001:0":{"text":"ど、どういうことなの！？真理の羽根が……ブローチの引換証に、変わってる……","source_cn":"这、这是怎么回事？真理之羽……变成了……一张胸针的提货单？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD52CD5546B09240","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1720767002:1":{"text":"そう。スーザンお婆さまが心血を注いで作ってくださったブローチよ。それを身につけることで、ひとりの職人へ敬意を示し、その想いに応えることもできるわね。","source_cn":"是的，那是苏珊婆婆用尽心血为你制作的胸针。戴上它，既是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84645222B9ACC048","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:3::2":{"text":"証明書","source_cn":"凭证","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88C1B926365E549F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1720767003:1":{"text":"そして金貨は……土地の権利証？","source_cn":"那这枚金币……变成了一张地契？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9B3803C47656134","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1720767004:1":{"text":"それは下層街の一画で、あなたに使用権が与えられている土地よ。","source_cn":"这是一块位于下城区的土地，你拥有这块土地的使用权。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE0DEADA5107C364C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:5::2":{"text":"土地の権利証","source_cn":"地契","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA5CADD655B7B945","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1720767005:1":{"text":"そこに孤児院でも建てれば……行き場のない子どもたちに、新しい家を与えられるわね。","source_cn":"如果在那里修建一座孤儿院的话，那些流浪的孩子，很快就会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x99B62106CFC14E66","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1720767006:0":{"text":"ハープは王立劇場のステージ招待券に……","source_cn":"竖琴变成了……皇家大剧院的邀请函？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC20D92743A1A26B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1720767007:1":{"text":"才能あふれる吟遊詩人が舞台を必要としているそうね。その招待券を持っていけば、彼はその歌声をサバンナ中に響かせられるんじゃないかしら。","source_cn":"我听说，有一位才华横溢的吟游诗人需要一个舞台。拿着这张...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA41BCD767DD2F7D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:8::2":{"text":"","source_cn":"","status":"picture_config_only","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1720767008:1":{"text":"王冠は……どうして花冠？","source_cn":"那这个王冠……为什么变成了花环？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA459610303F60F83","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1720767009:1":{"text":"それは冷たく重い王冠より、花冠のほうがあなたに相応しいと思ったからよ。柔らかな心を失わず、犠牲になった英雄たちを想いなさい。私たちのために血を流してくれた人々のことを、どうか忘れないで……","source_cn":"因为在你这个年纪，比起冰冷的王冠，作为母亲，我更希望你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E7A92DC2B998295","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:10::2":{"text":"花冠","source_cn":"花环","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4914AF0F181E0860","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1720767010:1":{"text":"ペギー、お誕生日おめでとう。私からのプレゼントは気に入ってくれた？","source_cn":"亲爱的女儿，这些就是我送你的生日礼物，你还喜欢吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7A9EF6A23CE272A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1720767011:0":{"text":"母上、でもどうして……って、まさか<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>ね！？","source_cn":"母后，你是怎么知道这些的？……难道说，是<style=...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x795059E19A32B167","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"母上、でもどうして……って、まさか<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>ね！？","female":"母上、でもどうして……って、まさか<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>ね！？","variant_male_record_index":"231855","variant_female_record_index":"231856","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1720767011":{"text":"母上、でもどうして……って、まさか<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>ね！？","source_cn":"母后，你是怎么知道这些的？……难道说，是<style=stress><player_name></style>！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x795059E19A32B167","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"母上、でもどうして……って、まさか<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>ね！？","female":"母上、でもどうして……って、まさか<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>ね！？","variant_male_record_index":"231855","variant_female_record_index":"231856","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1720767012:1":{"text":"なるほど……これが一夜にして成長できるという魔法の正体……","source_cn":"原来……这就是一夜长大的魔法……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1559E80F5A60C026","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1720767013:1":{"text":"近道や奇跡なんてなく、ただ絶えず模索しながら、自分の力で世界を少しずつ良くしていくしかない……そういうことでしょ？","source_cn":"没有捷径，也没有奇迹，只是不断去摸索，用更好的方式去关...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD59CC7D925F9A8C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1720767014:1":{"text":"そうよ、そしてあなたは成し遂げた。今の自分の姿を見てごらんなさい。昨日の脱走少女に比べて、ずっと本物の王女らしくなってるでしょう？","source_cn":"是的，我的女儿，你已经做到了。看看现在的你，难道不比昨...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x58CEB647D093385A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1720767015:1":{"text":"……母上、分かったわ！私、パーティーに参加する！","source_cn":"……母后，我明白了！我会回去参加宴会的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC05813FE6E6BE4C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1720767016:1":{"text":"でも、一つだけお願いがあるんだけど……聞いてくれる？","source_cn":"不过……关于我的生日宴会，我有个小小的请求，您能答应我吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2BE12BDEF969BAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1720767017:1":{"text":"もちろんよ。あなたが望むことなら、空の星だって取ってきてあげるわ。","source_cn":"当然，只要是你希望的，哪怕是要天上的星星，我也会答应你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A5906F1DB9E2DB1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:13:0:1":{"text":"古聖堂の演出は大変だったよ。","source_cn":"把圣古堂布置成这样可不容易","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xCCD0E9565D55CC76","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"古聖堂の演出は大変だったよ。","female":"古聖堂の演出は大変だったわ。","variant_male_record_index":"90219","variant_female_record_index":"90220","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:13:1:2":{"text":"今日のために、昨晩は働きっぱなしだったよ。","source_cn":"为了今天，昨晚我可没少忙活","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9E98EBA3ABEA44A1","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"今日のために、昨晩は働きっぱなしだったよ。","female":"今日のために、昨晩は働きっぱなしだったわ。","variant_male_record_index":"90221","variant_female_record_index":"90222","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:佩吉":{"text":"ペギー","source":"佩吉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:王后":{"tex